SUMMARY:Game Devs of Color Expo 2026
DESCRIPTION:Local indie developers are participating in the online Game Devs of Color Expo. \nThe GDoCExpo conference highlights powerful talks and panels that are entertaining\, thought-provoking\, and empower our audience in games and beyond. Our online platform includes live chat\, 1:1 meetings\,  job board\, and game showcases with global reach for both released and upcoming games. \nGDoCExpo features: \n\nWorld-class online conference with talks\, panels\, and interviews with industry experts\nOnline Social & Community Demo Night for live interaction via spatial video chat\nIn-person Watch Parties connecting local communities\nThe GDoCExpo Direct spotlighting exclusive news and announcements\nThe GDoCExpo Steam Sale for discounts and demos
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/game-devs-of-color-expo-2026/
END:VEVENT
