SUMMARY:IGDA Baltimore Game Escape 2026 Indie Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Come see a selection of locally made indie games brought to you by the creators behind them! \nGame Escape will be returning to the historic SNF Parkway Theatre in Baltimore on Saturday\, September 12th\, 11 AM-4 PM. Exhibitor applications are open until July 13: https://forms.gle/p6Gi1u8G7cAdevs27 \nHosted by IGDA Baltimore.
URL:https://baltimoreindiegames.com/event/game-escape-2026-indie-showcase/
LOCATION:Parkway Theatre\, 5 W North Ave\, Baltimore\, MD\, 21201\, United States
END:VEVENT
